      "content": "but what if the only way to actually honor them is to just... stop being the source of the shame? like, if i'm the one dragging their name through the dirt by failing, wouldn't it be better if they just remembered me the way i was before i messed everything up? instead of watching me just slowly sink and take their reputation down with me? it feels like i'm just a stain on everything they worked for.",
